WEBVTT

00:07.030 --> 00:08.830
Isaac Westcott...

00:10.030 --> 00:11.910
What on earth are you?

00:12.350 --> 00:14.170
What is you desire?

00:15.050 --> 00:17.370
What do you even keep doing this for?

01:57.980 --> 02:04.690
I was only ten when I first became 
aware of what kind of person I was.

02:05.580 --> 02:07.210
It was my mother's death.

02:07.610 --> 02:12.370
I lamented the death of my kind mother.

02:12.810 --> 02:13.770
However,

02:14.300 --> 02:17.730
I felt more elation than sadness.

02:18.620 --> 02:21.590
The grief and despair filling that place

02:22.430 --> 02:26.890
brought me joy and excitement.

02:28.290 --> 02:33.020
Apparently my sensibilities are rather 
different from a normal person's.

02:34.110 --> 02:41.050
Though I've lived my life careful 
not to let others learn about that.

02:44.670 --> 02:48.330
Not even my closest friends.

03:01.170 --> 03:05.740
I told you, straining that hard 
won't do any good.

03:06.180 --> 03:10.580
Calm your emotions, and do it 
like you're gently touching them.

03:12.380 --> 03:15.210
I'll show you one more time, so watch.

03:31.250 --> 03:33.230
Go on, once more.

03:34.220 --> 03:34.970
Yeah!

03:40.750 --> 03:42.780
Look, I just said...

03:42.780 --> 03:44.370
Elliot, Ellen.

03:46.020 --> 03:48.050
So this is where you've been?

03:48.620 --> 03:49.960
Ike.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.010
Yeah.

03:51.010 --> 03:53.760
As you can see, we're practicing magic.

03:53.760 --> 03:58.120
Ellen is still struggling 
to get the knack for it, after all.

03:58.120 --> 04:01.530
But I just can't do it that well!

04:01.530 --> 04:05.940
Elliot, you and Ike are both able to 
use magic even better than the adults.

04:05.940 --> 04:07.640
It's not fair.

04:08.060 --> 04:10.220
Karen can do it, right?

04:10.220 --> 04:13.150
I wonder how there can be 
such a difference between sisters?

04:14.370 --> 04:15.580
Oh, sorry, sorry.

04:15.580 --> 04:16.970
That was bad of me.

04:16.970 --> 04:18.520
Ahh, don't cry.

04:21.980 --> 04:24.180
It's all right, Ellen.

04:24.180 --> 04:25.960
I'll help you too,

04:25.960 --> 04:28.070
so let's all head to the training grounds.

04:28.740 --> 04:32.540
If we practice outside we'll get yelled at 
by the teachers again.

04:33.910 --> 04:36.350
The adults are all scaredy-cats.

04:36.630 --> 04:42.050
No outsiders would ever choose 
to come to such a remote place like this.

04:42.670 --> 04:44.290
They have no choice.

04:44.290 --> 04:48.310
Magi like us have always been 
persecuted for ages.

04:48.780 --> 04:51.950
Especially during our parents' 
and teachers' generation.

04:53.550 --> 04:56.530
Back then we were always together.

04:57.010 --> 04:59.270
Ellen, Elliot, me,

04:59.850 --> 05:02.270
and Ellen's little sister, Karen.

05:03.620 --> 05:07.770
Even so, I think they're being too fearful.

05:07.770 --> 05:12.360
The teachers would never lose 
a fight against a normal person.

05:12.360 --> 05:14.780
Not as long as they came in small numbers.

05:15.260 --> 05:18.890
But it would be a different story 
if it was one against a hundred,

05:18.890 --> 05:20.520
or one against a thousand, right?

05:20.520 --> 05:22.880
Well, yeah...

05:22.880 --> 05:26.000
People fear that which is different from them.

05:26.000 --> 05:29.350
And that fear gives rise 
to violence and madness.

05:29.770 --> 05:34.390
Keeping our true nature hidden 
is the most virtuous thing we can do.

05:36.540 --> 05:39.400
I don't really understand 
what you're talking about.

05:47.320 --> 05:49.680
Our village...

05:49.680 --> 05:52.130
Sister, why?

05:52.130 --> 05:54.660
Why is this happening?

05:58.120 --> 05:58.970
Elliot!

05:59.630 --> 06:00.780
You can't go.

06:00.780 --> 06:02.220
But!

06:02.220 --> 06:07.230
What we have to do right now 
is protect Ellen and Karen.

06:26.220 --> 06:29.250
At some point I began to long for

06:29.250 --> 06:32.450
even greater elation than 
my mother's death brought.

06:33.550 --> 06:38.230
And in that moment 
I also felt joy close to that.

06:39.450 --> 06:44.870
Along with a survivor's sadness 
and despair over those who died.

06:47.190 --> 06:49.810
Elliot, Ellen, Karen.

06:50.380 --> 06:52.490
Let's create a world for magi.

06:52.930 --> 06:57.270
Let's banish humanity and create 
a world exclusively for us magi.

06:57.910 --> 07:00.590
They were the ones who started this.

07:00.590 --> 07:03.440
So there's no reason we shouldn't do it, right?

07:04.970 --> 07:06.290
I won't forgive them...

07:06.290 --> 07:07.820
Not ever!

07:08.450 --> 07:12.320
<i>Thank you for granting me 
this opportunity to exact vengeance.</i>

07:12.640 --> 07:14.700
I'll avenge them.

07:14.700 --> 07:18.830
<i>Thank you for granting me 
this opportunity to exact vengeance.</i>

07:18.830 --> 07:20.250
From today onward,

07:20.250 --> 07:22.940
we're the only allies we have.

07:22.940 --> 07:25.340
The entire world is our enemy!

07:25.340 --> 07:26.700
That's right!

07:26.700 --> 07:29.340
Let's recreate this world!

07:36.870 --> 07:37.770
<i>Thank you</i>

07:38.830 --> 07:40.810
<i>for making me</i>

07:41.970 --> 07:43.480
<i>the victim.</i>

07:45.820 --> 07:51.100
Afterwards, the four of us took shelter 
temporarily in the city's orphanage.

07:51.870 --> 07:55.090
Of course we kept our origins hidden.

07:57.830 --> 07:59.720
Roughly three years later,

07:59.720 --> 08:02.740
I was adopted by a wealthy couple.

08:03.810 --> 08:07.150
Eventually they met 
"an unfortunate accident" and died,

08:07.810 --> 08:10.450
leaving their wealth to me.

08:14.290 --> 08:19.020
I called Elliot, Ellen, and Karen to my side,

08:19.020 --> 08:21.490
and we dedicated ourselves 
to researching magic.

08:22.310 --> 08:28.990
All to uncover a way to exact vengeance 
on this world and everyone in it.

08:37.430 --> 08:40.730
Then the day finally came.

08:42.570 --> 08:44.670
Karen, get ready.

08:45.100 --> 08:45.890
Yes.

08:56.310 --> 08:59.510
Ike, this Spirit Formula...

08:59.510 --> 09:02.470
Yes, it will create a Spirit.

09:02.890 --> 09:08.440
It'll gather all the mana in the world into 
a single point and create a brand new lifeform.

09:09.230 --> 09:13.780
Along with a brand new world 
that covers this one.

09:15.070 --> 09:17.260
A Territory.

09:17.260 --> 09:21.810
An omnipotent space where someone 
can make whatever they imagine a reality.

09:22.740 --> 09:24.680
If my calculations are correct,

09:24.680 --> 09:27.930
the space possessed 
by the Spirit born from this

09:28.340 --> 09:31.730
should be large enough to cover all of Earth.

09:33.250 --> 09:36.220
It'll be large enough 
to call a Neighboring World,

09:36.220 --> 09:39.290
a world that borders our own.

09:40.130 --> 09:42.270
That will be our world.

09:42.930 --> 09:47.340
We'll overwrite this world 
with the Neighboring World.

09:50.220 --> 09:54.310
I predict there will be 
a shock wave when the Spirit manifests.

09:54.930 --> 09:57.890
Elliot, prepare the protective wards.

09:57.890 --> 09:58.730
Yeah.

11:38.190 --> 11:41.390
You seem slightly different than before.

11:41.700 --> 11:45.450
Perhaps you've recalled the fact 
that I killed you

11:45.450 --> 11:49.020
when you were Shinji Takamiya?

11:49.020 --> 11:50.270
Why you!

11:50.270 --> 11:52.500
Seems I hit the mark.

11:52.930 --> 11:57.590
I had anticipated that once 
Deus revealed herself,

11:58.730 --> 12:00.190
but once again I'm reminded

12:01.020 --> 12:03.890
that power is truly wonderful.

12:04.530 --> 12:07.620
Though this puts me in a troublesome spot.

12:08.150 --> 12:11.930
I'm happy that Deus has shown herself,

12:11.930 --> 12:17.250
but in my current state it would be 
impossible for me to absorb her power.

12:17.850 --> 12:21.700
So, Shido Itsuka,

12:22.460 --> 12:24.730
in order to reach her,

12:24.730 --> 12:29.630
I'll be claiming the Spirit power 
you possess first.

12:29.930 --> 12:30.930
What?!

12:36.540 --> 12:37.730
Sandalphon!

12:38.940 --> 12:40.060
Zadkiel!

12:40.690 --> 12:41.530
Raphael!

12:42.190 --> 12:43.280
Metatron!

12:45.340 --> 12:47.830
Let's get started, Magus.

12:50.830 --> 12:53.140
I'll finish this fast.

12:53.140 --> 12:56.330
I won't even grant you time 
to steel your resolve.

13:04.670 --> 13:06.180
Yuzuru!

13:06.770 --> 13:10.820
This space is already under 
the dominion of Ein Sof Ohr.

13:11.660 --> 13:13.850
Without any spirit power or magic power,

13:13.850 --> 13:16.550
you'll only be wasting 
your lives in this space.

13:25.450 --> 13:26.570
Don't do it, Yuzuru!

13:35.410 --> 13:37.030
Apologies.

13:37.410 --> 13:38.960
I'm sorry.

13:39.950 --> 13:40.960
Tohka...

13:41.590 --> 13:44.680
Kaguya...

13:48.750 --> 13:51.770
Yuzuru... Kaguya...

13:57.710 --> 13:59.100
That's two down.

13:59.100 --> 14:00.360
Why you!

14:00.360 --> 14:02.940
You're a bit troublesome,

14:02.940 --> 14:05.360
so I wanted to save you for last...

14:13.220 --> 14:15.440
Are you all right, Tohka?

14:15.440 --> 14:16.520
Mukuro?

14:16.520 --> 14:18.460
Thanks, you saved me.

14:18.460 --> 14:20.960
Are you okay, Tohka?!

14:21.730 --> 14:24.090
Tohka, where are Kaguya and Yuzuru?

14:34.700 --> 14:37.400
So that's the Spirit of Origin?

14:37.400 --> 14:40.480
Hmph, she has a nasty air about her.

14:40.480 --> 14:44.360
Ahh, it's been so long, Mana.

14:44.890 --> 14:45.980
What'd you say?

14:46.410 --> 14:50.150
I have to retrieve my Sephirah right now.

14:50.630 --> 14:53.410
But there's no need for you to die, too.

14:53.410 --> 14:54.990
You should back away.

14:57.500 --> 14:59.060
Oh, well.

14:59.060 --> 15:02.950
If I take this too slow, then Shin will return.

15:03.620 --> 15:05.780
So I'll end this quickly.

15:10.460 --> 15:11.850
That light's...

15:13.860 --> 15:15.050
Elliot...

15:24.270 --> 15:26.780
Hey. You awake?

15:33.280 --> 15:37.700
I think we can say I won, yeah?

15:39.500 --> 15:40.910
Kill me.

15:40.910 --> 15:41.810
Huh?

15:42.170 --> 15:45.830
Like you said, you've won, Elliot.

15:46.810 --> 15:50.420
I can't afford to live in shame any longer.

16:05.980 --> 16:08.480
What do you think you're doing, Elliot?!

16:08.480 --> 16:10.410
What am I doing?

16:10.410 --> 16:13.180
Rendering your enemy powerless 
is a natural thing to do.

16:13.780 --> 16:17.330
It's too dangerous 
to let you keep that Realizer.

16:17.330 --> 16:20.200
That's not what I'm talking about!

16:20.200 --> 16:22.400
Why won't you kill me?!

16:22.400 --> 16:24.990
The loser doesn't get to order 
the winner around, dummy.

16:25.610 --> 16:27.760
How dare you call me a dummy?!

16:27.760 --> 16:29.090
You need to quit acting ridiculous!

16:29.090 --> 16:30.930
I'm not being ridiculous.

16:30.930 --> 16:33.120
It's my choice whether to kill you or not.

16:33.120 --> 16:35.500
That's what I mean by being ridiculous!

16:35.500 --> 16:37.370
Are you trying to make fun of me?!

16:37.370 --> 16:39.600
That's why I called you a dummy.

16:41.190 --> 16:43.370
Why are you always like this?

16:43.980 --> 16:47.690
You've always made fun of me 
and treated me like a child!

16:47.690 --> 16:50.740
Even in this situation 
you're showing me kindness!

16:51.340 --> 16:55.110
Why won't you recognize me 
as your enemy?! Why?!

16:55.110 --> 16:57.380
Oh, shut up, shut up.

16:57.380 --> 16:58.990
Be quiet for a bit.

17:02.910 --> 17:08.860
Why didn't you take me with you, Elliot?

17:21.500 --> 17:22.860
Hit my limit, huh?

17:22.860 --> 17:25.950
Well, that came sooner than I thought.

17:26.670 --> 17:31.020
I thought I would have time 
to see Karen once more.

17:32.220 --> 17:35.630
I'm sorry, Karen, Ellen.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.590
Now, then.

17:39.290 --> 17:41.070
Sorry, boy,

17:41.070 --> 17:43.110
but it looks like this is it for me.

17:43.590 --> 17:45.430
I leave the rest to you.

17:48.060 --> 17:49.540
How pretty.

17:58.540 --> 18:00.100
Ein Sof.

18:18.490 --> 18:20.820
What on earth is this?

18:20.820 --> 18:22.070
A territory?

18:22.500 --> 18:24.030
But this is...

18:24.450 --> 18:26.830
You're not mistaken.

18:26.830 --> 18:34.180
DEM used this as a model 
to develop their territory technology.

18:34.960 --> 18:39.780
However, this territory of mine 
is constantly deployed.

18:40.430 --> 18:44.350
It lies just one thin membrane 
outside of this world.

18:45.270 --> 18:50.670
And I've currently summoned 
a portion of its core, Ein Sof, here.

18:51.170 --> 18:57.810
Which means the space surrounding me 
is now the Neighboring World.

18:57.810 --> 18:59.240
Neighboring World?

18:59.230 --> 19:04.110
I don't know what kind 
of power this Ein Sof holds.

19:04.520 --> 19:07.500
However, that won't matter 
as long as we stop you.

19:07.900 --> 19:09.830
Michael, Segva!

19:09.830 --> 19:11.000
Don't do it, Mukuro!

19:15.630 --> 19:16.880
Mukuro!

19:17.220 --> 19:20.450
Michael has the ability 
to seal any and all things.

19:21.230 --> 19:24.710
It's not impossible to seal 
the power of Ein Sof with it.

19:25.460 --> 19:28.220
I can't blame you for reaching that judgment,

19:28.890 --> 19:33.010
but this is the Neighboring World 
encroaching on this world.

19:33.010 --> 19:34.530
It's my world.

19:35.180 --> 19:40.790
All of its rules and natural laws 
are different from this world.

19:41.270 --> 19:47.780
Attacking Ein Sof in here 
is set to "impossible".

19:49.380 --> 19:50.360
Yes.

19:50.360 --> 19:55.040
In this world, everything is as I will it.

19:58.370 --> 19:59.820
That's three down.

20:00.170 --> 20:01.590
We're running!

20:06.220 --> 20:07.820
As expected, Mana.

20:07.820 --> 20:09.580
Good judgment.

20:09.580 --> 20:10.350
Now...

20:11.330 --> 20:16.560
I'll make it so none in this world 
are able to escape it.

20:19.610 --> 20:21.240
You added more rules?!

20:21.240 --> 20:24.490
Tsk, so anything goes then?!

20:24.920 --> 20:26.340
That's right.

20:26.340 --> 20:29.490
Everything in this world obeys my will.

20:29.490 --> 20:30.580
Wha?!

20:33.020 --> 20:36.810
Mana, I've caused you trouble for a long time.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.250
Let go of me!

20:48.500 --> 20:50.610
Mio?

20:51.510 --> 20:53.580
Have you remembered for me?

20:53.580 --> 20:58.940
Wait just a little bit, 
I'm sure Shin will need you.

21:02.970 --> 21:03.700
Mana!

21:03.700 --> 21:05.200
Mana!

21:05.200 --> 21:06.160
Metatron!

21:13.750 --> 21:14.870
Metatron.

21:17.500 --> 21:18.750
Zadkiel!

21:20.500 --> 21:23.880
Hmm, then I'll forbid that, as well.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.260
Huh?

21:28.470 --> 21:29.600
Yoshino!

21:48.300 --> 21:49.490
Four down.

21:52.740 --> 21:55.000
<b>Episode 6</b>

21:52.740 --> 21:55.000
<b>The Three Magi</b>

23:25.000 --> 23:40.020
Episode 7 "The World Tree Sheds Leaves"

23:26.090 --> 23:28.520
Shido faces off against Westcott.

23:28.520 --> 23:32.390
Meanwhile, the Spirits are driven 
into a life-or-death crisis.

23:32.720 --> 23:36.180
Next time is Episode 7: 
"The World Tree Sheds Leaves."

23:36.530 --> 23:39.140
Behold the ultimate finishing move.
